{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-033-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/LedgerTraceTests.cs","line":294,"method":"EmitStructural_Enabled_EmitsOneInfoStructuralLine","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/LedgerTrace.cs:250; drop the '[INFO]' level or the funds= formatting -> red; a duplicated emit at the same line -> still green because only Contains is asserted","what_it_asserts":"EmitStructural with ForceEnabledForTesting emits an Info [LedgerTrace] phase=Structural line carrying funds=100.00 and facilities=[VAB:1].","why_weak":"The name and the one-line-per-recalc contract say one line, but the assertion is Assert.Contains over logLines, so a second emit (duplicated Info call) reds nothing. Assert.Single or a count of matching lines is feasible and cheap.","proposed_action":"Replace Assert.Contains with Assert.Single over the phase=Structural lines (or assert the matching count is 1).","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
